net Mars Spr. 7806.\n — c〉 N. pr. eines Buddha und verschiedener anderer Männer.\n— 4〉 f. आ\n — a〉 eine weiss- und blaublühende Dūrvā RĀJAN. 8,108.\n — b〉 *Gelbwurz.\n — c〉 *eine Karañja-Art RĀJAN. 6,199.\n — d〉 eine treue Gattin.\n — e〉 eine Form der Gattin Śivaʼs HEMĀDRI 1,415,19.\n — f〉 N. pr. der Mutter des 5ten Arhantʼs in der gegenwärtigen Avasarpiṇī.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["मंगल", "मङ्गलं", "मङ्गलः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["maMgala", "maNgalaM", "maNgalaH"]}, {"id": "mANgala", "headword": "माङ्गल", "headword_slp1": "mANgala", "fold": "maNgala", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "माङ्गल n. Pl. Bez. bestimmter Verse in einem den Aśvin geweihten liturgischen Abschnitte.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "maNgalakaraRa": [{"id": "maNgalakaraRa", "headword": "मङ्गलकरण", "headword_slp1": "maNgalakaraRa", "fold": "maNgalakaraRa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "मङ्गलकरण n. das Sprechen eines Gebets vor dem Beginn einer Unternehmung.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["मंगलकरण"], "synonyms_slp1": ["maMgalakaraRa"]}], "maNgalakalasamaya": [{"id": "maNgalakalaSamaya", "headword": "मङ्गलकलशमय", "headword_slp1": "maNgalakalaSamaya", "fold": "maNgalakalasamaya", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "मङ्गलकलशमय Adj. aus lauter festlichen Töpfen bestehend HARṢAC. 101,10.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "maNgalakaraka": [{"id": "maNgalakAraka", "headword": "मङ्गलकारक", "headword_slp1": "maNgalakAraka", "fold": "maNgalakaraka", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "मङ्गलकारक Adj. glückbringend.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "maNgalakuWaramisra": [{"id": "maNgalakuWAramiSra", "headword": "मङ्गलकुठारमिश्र", "headword_slp1": "maNgalakuWAramiSra", "fold": "maNgalakuW